{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOn"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Retries the upstream ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" up to a specified number of times only when a specific error type is encountered.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"retry"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"retries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su","text":"UInt"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOnCast","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO11RetryOnCastC","text":"RetryOnCast"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC","text":"RetryByCountStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"tex